  "lessons": [
    {
      "key": "lesson-1",
      "title": "参观 VR 实验室",
      "description": null,
      "sort_order": 1,
      "duration": null,
      "teaching_tip": null,
      "start_at": null,
      "end_at": null,
      "location": null,
      "presentation_type": "visit",
      "content_state": "preparing",
      "article_url": null,
      "article_title": "第一次课",
      "moments_note": null,
      "review_content": null,
      "report_guidance": null,
      "experiment_guidance": null,
      "article_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-0",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "天朗气清，金风送爽，很高兴踏进北航附中的校园和大家相遇，一起来回顾一下这节课上发生了什么吧！"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-1",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-01"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "首先是在教室里和大家明确了课程安排和纪律要求，希望大家好好遵守，能够在学习结束的时候收获高端的知识、难忘的体验还有一个漂亮的分数！"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-3",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "然后我们一起前往位于北航内部的虚拟现实全国重点实验室，一起参观和体验里面的“精密”仪器"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "开飞机"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-6",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-7",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-8",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-05"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "做手术"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-10",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-06"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "当牙医"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-12",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-07"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-13",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-08"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "VR不仅是一个眼镜那么简单，一切把现实世界移到屏幕里面的技术都可以是VR技术。大家也会在之后的课程中看到更多和VR相关的技术，借助这些技术，我们可以在教室里就实现上九天揽月！"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-15",
          "type": "image",
          "title": "",
          "caption": "",
          "resourceKey": "image-09"
        },
        {
          "id": "source-209db3615aef-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "希望大家在今后的课程中继续积极参与，聆听星海的声音，看见更美的风景！"
        }
      ]
    },
